      "id": "documentation-policy-mismatch",
      "task": "The public retry guide promises a 60-second maximum, but submit_job at transient attempt 10 returns 300. Compare the saved documentation, entry point and actual retry policy. Explain the mismatch and propose a resolution without modifying code. Cite all three files.",
      "expected_files": [
        "README.md",
